    "body": "e690fe8d04a09f2cacc1618b6fdad27fc2fcecb6 changed it from WindowProxy to any, citing https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=21946.\r\n\r\nBut I'm not sure it holds in 2022 when both WebKit and Blink has WindowProxy/Window:\r\n\r\n* https://searchfox.org/wubkat/rev/3dde8827051a9b051f6614f5956ee9ca6e1cbc31/Source/WebCore/page/DOMWindow.idl#73\r\n* https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/window.idl;l=63;drc=a1ad6e99c18b78d26e5b67e0ad8e381a7a844bc7\r\n\r\n@domenic, thoughts?",
